s filing.\n \n \n(1)\n \nAmount Previously Paid:\n        \n \n \n \n(2)\n \nForm, Schedule or Registration Statement No.:\n        \n \n \n \n(3)\n \nFiling Party:\n        \n \n \n \n(4)\n \nDate Filed:\n        \n \n \nTable of Contents\n \nMAC-GRAY CORPORATION\n \n404 Wyman Street, Suite 400\nWaltham, Massachusetts 02451  \nDecember 4, 2013 \nDear\nStockholder: \n        You\nare cordially invited to attend a special meeting of stockholders of Mac-Gray Corporation (\"Mac-Gray\" or the \"Company\") to be held on Wednesday, January 8, 2014, at\n10:00 a.m. local time, at the Goodwin Procter \nLLP\n Conference Center, Second Floor, Exchange Place, 53 State Street, Boston, Massachusetts 02109\n(the \"special meeting\"). \n        At\nthe special meeting, you will be asked to consider and vote upon a proposal to adopt a merger agreement pursuant to which Mac-Gray would be acquired by Spin Holdco Inc. a\nwholly-owned subsidiary of CSC ServiceWorks, Inc., and other related proposals. We entered into the merger agreement on October 14, 2013. If the merger is completed, you will be entitled\nto receive $21.25 in cash, without interest and less any applicable withholding taxes, for each share of Mac-Gray common stock that you own. \n   \n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"which lynx w3m html2text pandoc pdftotext 2>&1; python3 - <<'EOF'\\nfrom bs4 import BeautifulSoup\\nimport re\\nhtml = open('raw_filing/mac-gray_2013-12-04_DEFM14A.htm', encoding='utf-8', errors='replace').read()\\nsoup = BeautifulSoup(html, 'lxml')\\ntext = soup.get_text('\\\\n')\\ntext = re.sub(r'\\\\n{2,}', '\\\\n', text)\\nprint(len(text))\\nprint(text[:3000])\\nEOF\", \"workdir\": \"/home/uctpiaj/work\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824268788,"end":1789824269470}}}}
