y A counts as a round-1 participant although this bid row sits in round 0.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated proposal', [('P-018', 'On June 21, 2013, Party A submitted an unsolicited proposal to the Mac-Gray Board of Directors offering to purchase Mac-Gray for an all-cash purchase price of $17.00 to $19.00 per share, which we refer to as the Party A June 21 proposal')]),\\n     ('No formal signal and no substantive access yet', [('P-030', 'outside counsel to Party A and representatives of Goodwin Procter negotiated the terms of a confidentiality and standstill agreement, but did not come to agreement on the terms of the customer and employee non-solicitation provisions')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,6,21), date_to=D(2013,6,21), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=17.0, price_high=19.0, price_kind='Bidder range', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cond_detail=CC.format('not stated','not stated','no','not stated'),\\n    page=30, related='R003 (first contact); R012/R011 (round-1 participation); R027 (NDA)', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 10\\nrow('jun24_board', '06/24/2013', 'Mac-Gray Board of Directors', 'Target decision', 1, 0, None,\\n    'Board established the Special Committee of six independent and disinterested directors (Bullock, Daoust, Hyman, Meagher, Percelay, Robinson; Bullock chairman) and excluded Mr. MacDonald and Mr. Rothenberg from the Board\\\\u2019s evaluation of strategic alternatives because they could be asked to partner with a potential acquirer; Transaction Committee became a sub-committee.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated establishment', [('P-019', 'the Board then established the Special Committee, comprised of the six independent and disinterested members of the Board (namely, Mr. Bullock, Mr. Daoust, Mr. Hyman, William F. Meagher, Bruce A. Percelay and Alastair G. Robinson)')]),\\n     ('Exclusions', [('P-019', 'the Board decided, and Mr. MacDonald and Mr. Rothenberg agreed, 