ximate window', date_method='Assigned: bound',\\n    page=32, related='R011; R012', review='Q3; Q7')\\n\\n# 14\\nrow('nda_partyB', '06/28/2013', 'Party B (financial bidder)', 'NDA signed', 1, 1, 'Financial',\\n    'Executed a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray on Mac-Gray\\\\u2019s form (individually negotiated; no material variances) and received the informational package; standstill carried a sunset allowing confidential proposals on announcement of a business combination or change of control.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated execution and package', [('P-026', 'Later on June 28, 2013, Party B, entered into a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray and was provided with an informational package for the purpose of providing Party B with data to formulate a preliminary indication of interest')]),\\n     ('Form and standstill terms', [('P-023', 'entered into confidentiality agreements with Mac-Gray on a form provided by Mac-Gray, the terms of which were individually negotiated with potential bidders, but did not vary materially from the form provided')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,6,28), date_to=D(2013,6,28), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=32)\\n\\n# 15\\nrow('nda_partyC', '06/30/2013', 'Party C (financial bidder)', 'NDA signed', 1, 1, 'Financial',\\n    'Executed a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray and received the informational package on the same basis as the other signers.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated execution and package', [('P-027', 'On June 30, 2013, Party C entered into a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray and was provided with an informational package for the purpose of providing Party C with data to formulate a preliminary indication of interest')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,6,30), date_to=D(2013,6,30), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=32)\\n\\n# 16\\nrow('jul6_rollover', '07/06/2013', 'Mac-Gray Special Committee; Moab Partners (via Mr. Rothenberg); CSC/Pamplona', 'Material process update',\\n    1, 1, None,\\n    'Moab rollover request denied as premature: Mr. Rothenberg had asked that CSC/Pamplona be allowed to share bid and evaluation material with Moab, with Moab exclusively engaged with CSC/Pamplona; the Special Committee denied exclusivity so that Moab\\\\u2019s stake could remain available as capital for other bidders, and said rollover discussions would be permitted at a later stage.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated request', [('P-027', 'Mr. Rothenberg also informed Goodwin Procter that Pamplona would be requesting that any confidentiality agreement CSC/Pamplona execute with Mac-Gray permit CSC and Pamplona to discuss their bid and evaluation material with Moab, with Moab agreeing to exclusively engage with CSC/Pamplona')]),\\n     ('Stated denial and rationale', [('P-028', 'the Special Committee decided to deny the exclusivity request at this stage of the process so that the potential equity rollover of Moab\\\\u2019s shares could be available as a source of capital for other potential bidders')]),\\n     ('Deferral', [('P-028', 'it was premature for Mac-Gray to permit Moab to engage in equity rollover discussions with any party, including CSC/Pamplona, but that such discussions would be permitted at a later stage of the sale process')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,7,6), date_to=D(2013,7,6), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=32, related='R049 (resolution); R010', review='Q6')\\n\\n# 17\\nrow('deadline_set_0723', 'between 06/28/2013 and 07/23/2013 (communication date not disclosed)',\\n    'Mac-Gray (informational package) \\\\u2192 NDA signers', 'Deadline set', 1, 1, None,\\n    'Informational-package letter instructed NDA signers to submit preliminary indications of interest by 07/23/2013, addressing valuation, sources and structures of financing, material conditions (including required approvals) and due-diligence focus areas. Communication date not disclosed: the package was furnished to each party as it signed; first signer 06/28/2013.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated instruction', [('P-023', 'Parties that had entered into confidentiality and standstill agreements with Mac-Gray were furnished an informational package for the purpose of providing potential bidders with data to formulate a preliminary indication of interest, which they were instructed to submit by July 23, 2013')]),\\n     ('Requested proposal content', [('P-023', 'The letter requested that the proposals address, among other things, valuation, sources and structures of financing, material conditions, including required approvals, and focus areas for due diligence')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,6,28), date_to=D(2013,7,23), date_basis='Approximate window', date_method='Assigned: midpoint',\\n    due_date=D(2013,7,23), page=32, related='R020 (due date reached)', review='Q2; Q7')\\n\\n# 18\\nrow('nda_csc', '07/11/2013', 'CSC/Pamplona (strategic bidder)', 'NDA signed', 1, 1, 'Strategic',\\n    'CSC and Pamplona entered into a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray jointly (one bidder unit) and received the informational package.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated execution and package', [('P-029', 'On July 11, 2013, CSC/Pamplona entered into a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray and were provided with an informational package for the purpose of providing CSC/Pamplona with data to formulate a preliminary indication of interest')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,7,11), date_to=D(2013,7,11), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=33)\\n\\n# 19 residual NDA cohort\\nrow('nda_residual16', 'late June through late August 2013 (individual dates not disclosed)',\\n    '16 remaining financial bidders (residual cohort)', 'NDA signed', 1, 1, 'Financial',\\n    'Residual cohort: 20 potential bidders signed confidentiality and standstill agreements over roughly two months;