tion due date passed with no submission)',\\n    '16 remaining financial bidders (residual cohort)', 'Did not submit', 1, 1, 'Financial',\\n    'Inferred: residual \\\\u2014 20 NDA signers \\\\u2212 4 individually recorded signers (Party A, Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona) = 16 remaining signers, all financial; none is reported to have submitted a July 23 indication. Base assumes each of the 20 signers was covered by the July 23 solicitation; if any signed later than that deadline, the non-submitting set is smaller (flagged in Q3). Inferred from arithmetic only \\\\u2014 no dates, motives or identities inferred.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Base population', [('P-023', 'a total of 20 potential bidders, including two strategic bidders (Party A and CSC/Pamplona) and 18 financial bidders (including Party B and Party C), entered into confidentiality agreements with Mac-Gray')]),\\n     ('Continuing set named at the next transition', [('P-034', 'reach out to each of the four interested bidders and arrange management meetings')]),\\n     ('Solicitation due date', [('P-023', 'instructed to submit by July 23, 2013')])],\\n    count=16, date_from=None, date_to=D(2013,7,23), date_basis='Relative only', date_method='Assigned: deadline',\\n    decided_by='Unknown', exit_reason='Not stated', outcome_basis='Inferred: residual',\\n    page=32, related='R019 (entry); R020', review='Q3')\\n\\n# 22\\nrow('bid_csc_jul23', '07/23/2013', 'CSC/Pamplona (strategic bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 1, 'Strategic',\\n    'Preliminary indication of interest: all-cash $18.50 per share, submitted on the 07/23/2013 due date after a preliminary review (07/11\\\\u201307/23) but before data-room or management access; financing not described at this stage.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated indication', [('P-031', 'On July 23, 2013, CSC/Pamplona submitted a preliminary indication of interest at an all-cash purchase price of $18.50 per share')]),\\n     ('Substantive access not yet given', [('P-030', 'Between July 11, 2013 and July 23, 2013, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona engaged in a preliminary review of Mac-Gray and the potential acquisition opportunity')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,7,23), date_to=D(2013,7,23), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=18.50, price_high=18.50, price_kind='Point', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cash_close=18.50, cond_detail=CC.format('not stated','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=33, related='R030 (Sept 9 revision); R037; R042', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 23\\nrow('bid_partyB_jul24', '07/24/2013', 'Party B (financial bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 1, 'Financial',\\n    'Preliminary indication of interest: all-cash $17.00\\\\u2013$18.00 per share, submitted one day after the 07/23/2013 instruction and considered at the 07/25/2013 Special Committee meeting.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated indication', [('P-032', 'On July 24, 2013, Party B submitted a preliminary indication of interest at an all-cash purchase price of $17.00 to $18.00 per share')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,7,24), date_to=D(2013,7,24), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=17.0, price_high=18.0, price_kind='Bidder range', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cond_detail=CC.format('not stated','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=33, related='R031 (Sept 9 revision)', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 24\\nrow('bid_partyC_jul24', '07/24/2013 (oral indication) \\\\u2013 07/25/2013 (written indication)',\\n    'Party C (financial bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 1, 'Financial',\\n    'One bid, two communications: an oral preliminary indication on 07/24/2013 at $15.00\\\\u2013$17.00 per share, then a written indication on 07/25/2013 at $16.00\\\\u2013$16.50 per share. Recorded as a single bid under the one-communication convention; the written range is recorded in the price cells and both values are stated here. All-cash; financing not described.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Oral indication', [('P-032', 'representatives from Party C called BofA Merrill Lynch and presented an oral preliminary indication of interest at an all-cash purchase price of $15.00 to $17.00 per share')]),\\n     ('Written indication', [('P-035', 'Later on July 25, 2013, Party C submitted a written indication of interest at an all-cash purchase price of $16.00 to $16.50 per share')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,7,24), date_to=D(2013,7,25), date_basis='Reported interval', date_method='Assigned: bound',\\n    price_low=16.0, price_high=16.50, price_kind='Bidder range', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cond_detail=CC.format('not stated','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=33, related='R033 (Sept 10 revision)', review='Q5; Q7')\\n\\n# 25\\nrow('jul25_decision', '07/25/2013', 'Mac-Gray Special Committee', 'Target decision', 1, 1, None,\\n    'Preliminary indications judged lower than expected; the Special Committee advanced the four interested bidders (Party A, Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona) to a second stage \\\\u2014 staged information disclosure and management meetings \\\\u2014 to drive improved offers. The Special Committee also directed that Mr. Rothenberg recuse himself from Board meetings for the duration of the sale process (Moab rollover conflict).',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Advancement decision', [('P-035', 'the Special Committee authorized and instructed BofA Merrill Lynch to proceed with the staged disclosure as discussed at this meeting and to reach out to each of the four interested bidders and arrange management meetings')]),\\n     ('Recusal', [('P-033', 'The Special Committee then discussed the potential conflict of interest arising from Moab\\\\u2019s continuing desire to consider an equity rollover and decided that Mr. Rothenberg should be asked to recuse himself from participating in Board meetings for the duration of the sale process')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,7,25), date_to=D(2013,7,25), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=34, related='R026; R011', review='Q1')\\n\\n# 26\\nrow('jul25_access', '07/25/2013 (decision); implemented 08/06/2013\\\\u201308/27/2013',\\n    'Mac-Gray Special Committee; Party A, Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona', 'Information access changed',\\n    1, 1, None,\\n    'Differentiated (tiered) access among live bidders: Party B and Party C, as financial bidders, were given broad access to the electronic data site; Party A and CSC/Pamplona, as strategic bidders, were given somewhat limited access, with customer data (including customer locations) withheld until a later stage; management presentations were held for all four bidders (08/06, 08/08, 08/12, 08/14). Stated rationale: concern over access to and potential misuse of sensitive competitive information, especially by strategic bidders; staging by demonstrated seriousness.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated access split and withholding', [('P-042', 'Party B and Party C, in light of the fact that they were financial bidders, were given broad access to an electronic data site, and Party A and CSC/Pamplona, in light of the fact that they were strategic bidders, were given somewhat limited access to this electronic data site, with access to customer data, including customer locations, being reserved until later in the process as part of the staging discussed at the July 25 th Special Committee meeting')]),\\n     ('Stated rationale', [('P-034', 'expressed concern over permitting access to and the potential misuse of sensitive and competitive information, including customer terms and locations, especially by strategic bidders')]),\\n     ('Presentations for all four', [('P-036', 'On August 6, 2013, representatives of Party B attended a management presentation'),\\n       ('P-040', 'On August 14, 2013, representatives of Party A attended a management presentation at the Boston office of Goodwin Procter')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,7,25), date_to=D(2013,7,25), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=34, related='R025')\\n\\n# 27\\nrow('nda_partyA', '08/05/2013', 'Party A (strategic bidder)', 'NDA signed', 1, 1, 'Strategic',\\n    'Executed after NDA negotiations stalled over customer and employee non-solicitation provisions; discussions resumed 07/27/2013 (the filing states \\\"July 27, 2103\\\" \\\\u2014 source typo; intended 2013) and the agreement was executed 08/05/2013; informational package furnished so Party A could potentially improve its June 21 proposal.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated execution', [('P-036', 'On August 5, 2013, Party A entered into a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray and was provided with an informational package for the purpose of providing Party A with data to potentially improve the terms of the Party A June 21 proposal')]),\\n     ('Stalled negotiation and source typo retained', [('P-036', 'Discussions with Party A resumed on July 27, 2103 and Party A and the Transaction Committee agreed to the terms of the customer and employee non-solicitation provisions'),\\n       ('P-030', 'did not come to agreement on the terms of the customer and employee non-solicitation provisions')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,8,5), date_to=D(2013,8,5), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=34)\\n\\n# 28\\nrow('r2_open', '08/27/2013', 'Mac-Gray (BofA Merrill Lynch) \\\\u2192 Party A, Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona', 'Round opened',\\n    1, 2, None,\\n    'Second-stage solicitation: letter to all four bidders once all four\\\\u2019s diligence was substantially complete, instructing revised written proposals no later than 09/09/2013 to continue to in-depth evaluation and confirmatory due diligence, addressing valuation, financing, regulatory approvals, post-signing covenants and diligence focus. Authorized at the 08/15/2013 Special Committee meeting; same-day follow-up diligence call with Party B. Round finality: Not final.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated authorization', [('P-041', 'the Special Committee authorized and instructed BofA Merrill Lynch to send a letter to each of Party A, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona once all four of the bidders\\\\u2019 due diligence was substantially complete requesting that, in light of the results of the respective party\\\\u2019s due diligence, such party submit a revised written proposal in order to continue in the process, including to engage in more in-depth and confirmatory due diligence of Mac-Gray')]),\\n     ('Stated letter and deadline', [('P-043', 'On August 27, 2013, BofA Merrill Lynch, as instructed by the Special Committee, sent a letter to each of Party A, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona instructing such bidders to submit revised written proposals no later than September 9, 2013 if such bidders wished to proceed further in the process to pursue an in-depth evaluation of Mac-Gray with the objective of making a revised offer')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,8,27), date_to=D(2013,8,27), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    due_date=D(2013,9,9), round_finality='Not final',\\n    page=35, related='R025; R029', review='Q1')\\n\\n# 29\\nrow('deadline_0909', '09/09/2013', 'N/A \\\\u2014 solicitation deadline', 'Deadline', 1, 2, None,\\n    'Revised-proposal due date reached. CSC/Pamplona and Party B submitted on 09/09/2013; Party A and Party C submitted revised indications on 09/10/2013 and were reviewed at the 09/11/2013 Special Committee meeting with no revision of the due date. Treatment: Late bids accepted.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Due date and on-time submissions', [('P-043', 'instructing such bidders to submit revised written proposals no later than September 9, 2013'),\\n       ('P-047', 'On September 9, 2013, CSC/Pamplona submitted a revised indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $19.50 per share')]),\\n     ('Late submissions reviewed', [('P-048', 'On September 10, 2013, Party A submitted a revised indication of interest'),\\n       ('P-050', 'the Special Committee held a telephonic meeting to review the revised indications of interest submitted by Party A, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,9,9), date_to=D(2013,9,9), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    due_date=D(2013,9,9), deadline_treatment='Late bids accepted',\\n    page=35, related='R028', review='Q2')\\n\\n# 30\\nrow('bid_csc_sep9', '09/09/2013', 'CSC/Pamplona (strategic bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 2, 'Strategic',\\n    'Revised indication of interest: all-cash $19.50 per share; Pamplona indicated it was committed to provide 100% of the capital required; CSC/Pamplona requested a two-week exclusive negotiation.',\\n    'Informal', 'Light',\\n    [('Stated indication and committed capital', [('P-047', 'On September 9, 2013, CSC/Pamplona submitted a revised indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $19.50 per share, indicating that Pamplona was committed to provide 100% of the capital required to consummate the transaction and requesting that CSC/Pamplona and Mac-Gray agree to exclusive negotiations for two weeks')]),\\n     ('Diligence still running', [('P-052', 'Between September 11, 2013 and September 18, 2013, Party A, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona continued to conduct business and legal due diligence')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,9), date_to=D(2013,9,9), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=19.50, price_high=19.50, price_kind='Point', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cash_close=19.50, cond_detail=CC.format('committed','not stated','yes','requested (2 wks)'),\\n    page=35, related='R037 (Sept 18 revision)', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 31\\nrow('bid_partyB_sep9', '09/09/2013', 'Party B (financial bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 2, 'Financial',\\n    'Revised indication of interest: all-cash $18.50 per share, proposed to be financed with equity from affiliated funds and third-party debt; no firm financing commitment.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated indication and financing', [('P-047', 'On September 9, 2013, Party B also submitted a revised indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $18.50 per share and proposed to finance the transaction with a combination of equity from affiliated funds and third party debt. Party B\\\\u2019s revised indication of interest did not include a firm financing commitment')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,9), date_to=D(2013,9,9), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=18.50, price_high=18.50, price_kind='Point', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cash_close=18.50, cond_detail=CC.format('not committed','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=35, related='R039 (Sept 18 revision)', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 32\\nrow('bid_partyA_sep10', '09/10/2013', 'Party A (strategic bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 2, 'Strategic',\\n    'Revised indication of interest: all-cash $18.00\\\\u2013$19.00 per share, to be financed by outstanding credit facilities or affiliated equity sources; no firm financing commitment.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated indication', [('P-048', 'On September 10, 2013, Party A submitted a revised indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $18.00 to $19.00 per share, to be financed by outstanding credit facilities or affiliated equity sources')]),\\n     ('No firm commitment', [('P-049', 'Neither Party A\\\\u2019s nor Party C\\\\u2019s revised indication of interest included a firm financing commitment')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,10), date_to=D(2013,9,10), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=18.0, price_high=19.0, price_kind='Bidder range', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cond_detail=CC.format('not committed','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=35, related='R038 (Sept 18 best-and-final reiteration)', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 33\\nrow('bid_partyC_sep10', '09/10/2013', 'Party C (financial bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 2, 'Financial',\\n    'Revised oral indication of interest in a telephone call to BofA Merrill Lynch: all-cash $16.00\\\\u2013$17.00 per share; no firm financing commitment.',\\n    'Informal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated oral indication', [('P-049', 'in a telephone call to a representative of BofA Merrill Lynch, a representative of Party C indicated that it was submitting a revised oral indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $16.00 to $17.00 per share')]),\\n     ('No firm commitment', [('P-049', 'Neither Party A\\\\u2019s nor Party C\\\\u2019s revised indication of interest included a firm financing commitment')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,10), date_to=D(2013,9,10), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=16.0, price_high=17.0, price_kind='Bidder range', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cond_detail=CC.format('not committed','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=35, review='Q4')\\n\\n# 34\\nrow('macdonald_brief', '09/11/2013 (limited overview) \\\\u2013 09/12/2013 (detailed briefing)',\\n    'Mac-Gray Transaction Committee / BofA Merrill Lynch \\\\u2194 Mr. MacDonald', 'Material process update',\\n    1, 2, None,\\n    'Mr. MacDonald\\\\u2019s rollover question resolved: in a limited-overview call (no bidder identities or prices) he said he was not interested in rolling over any shares; the Special Committee agreed he should be fully briefed because any potential acquiror was seen as unlikely to proceed without knowing he would support the transaction; a 09/12/2013 detailed briefing followed, after which he voiced general support while urging a higher value.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated rollover position', [('P-049', 'During this call, Mr. MacDonald indicated that he had decided that he was not interested in rolling over any of his shares in any transaction')]),\\n     ('Stated support premise', [('P-050', 'it was unlikely that any of these parties would move forward in the process without the express support of Mr. MacDonald')]),\\n     ('Stated briefing and stance', [('P-051', 'Although Mr. MacDonald voiced his general support for continuing with the process, he expressed his view that Mac-Gray should continue to seek a higher value for stockholders')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,9,11), date_to=D(2013,9,12), date_basis='Reported interval', date_method='Assigned: bound',\\n    page=35, related='R016; R049; R041 (his 09/19 support at $21.25)', review='Q6; Q7')\\n\\n# 35\\nrow('r3_open', '09/11/2013', 'Mac-Gray Special Committee (via BofA Merrill Lynch) \\\\u2192 Party A, Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona',\\n    'Round opened', 1, 3, None,\\n    'First request for final indications of interest: BofA Merrill Lynch called each of the four bidders on 09/11/2013, as instructed, requesting final indications by 09/18/2013 and signaling that Mac-Gray would consider a short exclusive negotiation with one bidder depending on price and deal certainty. Invited bidders unchanged. Round finality: Announced as final \\\\u2014 the target asked for \\\"final indications of interest\\\".',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Stated instruction', [('P-050', 'the Special Committee instructed BofA Merrill Lynch to call each of Party A, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona to request final indications of interest by September 18, 2013 and to indicate that Mac-Gray would consider engaging in a short period of exclusive negotiations with one of the bidders depending upon, among other things, the proposed purchase price and the level of deal certainty indicated in the bidder\\\\u2019s final proposal')]),\\n     ('Calls made same day', [('P-050', 'representatives of BofA Merrill Lynch called each of Party A, Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona on September 11, 2013 with such instructions')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,9,11), date_to=D(2013,9,11), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    due_date=D(2013,9,18), round_finality='Announced as final',\\n    page=36, related='R036', review='Q1')\\n\\n# 36\\nrow('deadline_0918', '09/18/2013', 'N/A \\\\u2014 solicitation deadline', 'Deadline', 1, 3, None,\\n    'Final-indication due date reached. Three bidders responded on 09/18/2013 (CSC/Pamplona $20.75; Party A best-and-final reiteration; Party B $21.50 package); Party C did not submit (R040). The Special Committee took its next step on the bids in hand at its 09/19/2013 meeting \\\\u2014 selection of CSC/Pamplona and authorization to offer exclusivity at $21.25. Treatment: Enforced.',\\n    None, None,\\n    [('Due date and responses', [('P-050', 'to request final indications of interest by September 18, 2013'),\\n       ('P-053', 'On September 18, 2013, CSC/Pamplona submitted a proposal for an all-cash purchase price of $20.75 per share')]),\\n     ('Next step on the bids in hand', [('P-055', 'the Special Committee concluded that the revised indication of interest submitted by CSC/Pamplona had the potential of delivering the most value to stockholders, provided greater certainty and involved less potential risk than the other indications')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,9,18), date_to=D(2013,9,18), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    due_date=D(2013,9,18), deadline_treatment='Enforced',\\n    page=36, related='R035', review='Q2')\\n\\n# 37\\nrow('bid_csc_sep18', '09/18/2013', 'CSC/Pamplona (strategic bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 3, 'Strategic',\\n    'Final-solicited proposal: all-cash $20.75 per share; Pamplona reiterated it was committed to provide 100% of the capital required; requested two-week exclusive negotiations.',\\n    'Formal', 'Light',\\n    [('Stated proposal and commitment', [('P-053', 'On September 18, 2013, CSC/Pamplona submitted a proposal for an all-cash purchase price of $20.75 per share, reiterating that Pamplona was committed to provide 100% of the capital required to consummate the transaction and requesting that CSC/Pamplona and Mac-Gray agree to engage in exclusive negotiations for two weeks')]),\\n     ('Formal signal \\\\u2014 response on the requested basis to the final solicitation', [('P-050', 'to request final indications of interest by September 18, 2013')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,18), date_to=D(2013,9,18), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=20.75, price_high=20.75, price_kind='Point', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cash_close=20.75, cond_detail=CC.format('committed','not stated','yes','requested (2 wks)'),\\n    page=36, related='R042 (Sept 21 increase); R035', review='Q4')\\n\\n# 38\\nrow('bid_partyA_sep18', '09/18/2013', 'Party A (strategic bidder)', 'Bid reaffirmed', 1, 3, 'Strategic',\\n    'Reaffirmed by: price confirmed \\\\u2014 telephone reiteration that its earlier all-cash $18.00\\\\u2013$19.00 indication was Party A\\\\u2019s best and final offer; price carried forward from R032, not restated. Financing basis unchanged (outstanding credit facilities or affiliated equity; no firm commitment).',\\n    'Formal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated reaffirmation', [('P-053', 'Party A reiterated in a telephone call to a representative of BofA Merrill Lynch that its previous indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $18.00 to $19.00 per share was its best and final offer')]),\\n     ('Formal signal \\\\u2014 best-and-final response; standing conditions unchanged', [('P-049', 'Neither Party A\\\\u2019s nor Party C\\\\u2019s revised indication of interest included a firm financing commitment')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,18), date_to=D(2013,9,18), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=18.0, price_high=19.0, price_kind='Bidder range', price_origin='Carried forward', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='Yes', cond_detail=CC.format('not committed','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=36, related='R032 (carried price); R042 (later Party A dropped)', review='Q4; Q5')\\n\\n# 39\\nrow('bid_partyB_sep18', '09/18/2013', 'Party B (financial bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 3, 'Financial',\\n    'Revised indication valued by Party B at $21.50 per share: $19.00 cash at closing plus options representing 10% of the new equity with a strike price equal to Party B\\\\u2019s initial cost basis; options to vest over five years on achievement of the base-case management projections (excluding future acquisitions); Party B valued the options at $2.50 per share. Package value, not guaranteed cash; financing remained without a firm commitment.',\\n    'Formal', 'Heavy',\\n    [('Stated package and option terms', [('P-053', 'Party B also submitted a revised indication of interest with a purchase price that Party B valued at $21.50 per share, including $19.00 of cash to be paid at closing and the remaining per share price to be paid in the form of options to be issued to Mac-Gray stockholders, representing 10% of the new equity with a strike price equal to Party B\\\\u2019s initial cost basis. These options, which we refer to as the Party B options, would vest on the achievement of the base case management projections ( i.e. , over five years), excluding any future acquisitions. Party B\\\\u2019s proposal stated that it valued the Party B options at $2.50 of incremental value per share')]),\\n     ('Financing not committed; formal signal \\\\u2014 final-solicitation response', [('P-049', 'Neither Party A\\\\u2019s nor Party C\\\\u2019s revised indication of interest included a firm financing commitment')])],\\n    count=1, date_from=D(2013,9,18), date_to=D(2013,9,18), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    price_low=21.50, price_high=21.50, price_kind='Point', price_origin='Stated', currency='USD',\\n    all_cash='No', cash_close=19.00, cond_detail=CC.format('not committed','not stated','yes','not stated'),\\n    page=36, related='R031 (prior priced bid)', review='Q4; Q5')\\n\\n# 40\\nrow('dns_partyC', 'by 09/18/2013 (final-indica