se their offer price above $20.75. The Special Committee then authorized the Transaction Committee to inform CSC/Pamplona that the Special Committee would be prepared to move into exclusivity at a price of $21.25 per share'),\\n       ('P-055', 'at this meeting Mr. MacDonald indicated that he would be supportive of a price of $21.25 per share')])],\\n    date_from=D(2013,9,19), date_to=D(2013,9,19), date_basis='Reported day', date_method='Reported',\\n    page=37, related='R042; R043')\\n\\n# 42\\nrow('bid_csc_sep21', '09/21/2013', 'CSC/Pamplona (strategic bidder)', 'Bid', 1, 3, 'Strategic',\\n    'Price increase to $21.25 per share all-cash as a last and best offer, provided Mac-Gray agreed to a two-week exclusive negotiation; CSC/Pamplona also requested a customary voting agreement over Mr. MacDonald\\\\u2019s and his immediate family\\\\u2019s shares. This is the price component of the CSC/Pamplona final proposal (no financing contingency; Pamplona committing 100% of the capital needed for closing).',\\n    'Formal', 'Light',\\n    [('Stated confirmation', [('P-056', 'the representative of CSC/Pamplona called the members of the Transaction Committee to confirm that CSC/Pamplona were willing to increase their all-cash purchase price to $21.25 per share as a last and best offer, provided that Mac-Gray agree to a two week period of exclusive negotiations')]),\\n     ('Voting agreement request', [('P-056', 'The representative of CSC/Pamplona also requested that shares of Mac-Gray common stock owned beneficially and of record by Mr. MacDonald and his immediate family be subject to a customary voting agreement, which we refer to as the MacDonald voting agreements')]),\\n     ('Final proposal terms', [('P-057', 'the inclusion of a $15 million \\\"reverse\\\" termination fee payable by CSC/Pamplona to Mac-Gray in the event regulatory clearance is not obtained, which we refer to as the CSC reverse termination fee, agreements regarding certain post-signing covenants, the f