{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824995619,"sessionID":"ses_f46293753ffeU5Yf7iVUgOE0mm","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e204f40016Ph0izdjIAHXFQ","sessionID":"ses_f46293753ffeU5Yf7iVUgOE0mm","messageID":"msg_0b9e1f8d30018zyuY7OzBYmQVR","type":"tool","id":"call_00_VGeZN1L3N3tHXDAy6nHd8299","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/uctpiaj/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, re, unicodedata\ndata = json.load(open('/tmp/opencode/ledger_data.json'))\nparas = {p['id']: p['text'] for p in data['paras']}\nxp = {x['id']: x['text'] for x in data['xpass']}\nall_sources = {**paras, **xp}\ndef an(s):\n    s = s.replace('\\u2019',\"'\").replace('\\u2018',\"'\").replace('\\u201c','\"').replace('\\u201d','\"')\n    s = re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',s)\n    return s.strip()\nalln = {k: an(v) for k,v in all_sources.items()}\n\nfails = [\n ('r1_open','the Special Committee concluded that it would be in the best interests of stockholders to consider a potential sale of Mac-Gray'),\n ('nda_partyB','Later on June 28, 2013, Party B, entered into a confidentiality and standstill agreement with Mac-Gray and was provided with an informational package for the purpose of providing Party B with data to formulate a preliminary indication of interest'),\n ('deadline_0723','representatives of BofA Merrill Lynch reviewed the preliminary indications of interest received from Party B, Party C and CSC/Pamplona as well as the Party A June 21 proposal'),\n ('jul25_decision','the Special Committee authorized and instructed BofA Merrill Lynch to proceed with the staged disclosure as discussed at this meeting and to reach out to each of the four interested bidders and arrange management meetings'),\n ('jul25_access','On August 6, 2013, representatives of Party B attended a management presentation'),\n ('bid_partyA_sep10','Neither Party A\\u2019s nor Party C\\u2019s revised indication of interest included a firm financing commitment'),\n ('bid_partyC_sep10','in a telephone call to a representative of BofA Merrill Lynch, a representative of Party C indicated that it was submitting a revised oral indication of interest with an all-cash purchase price of $16.00 to $17.00 per share'),\n ('sep23_excl_auth','The parties also agreed that the exclusivity agreement would automatically terminate if CSC or Pamplona adversely changed any of the terms of the CSC/Pamplona final proposal'),\n ('sep24_excl_exec','On September 24, 2013, CSC, Pamplona and Mac-Gray executed the exclusivity agreement providing for exclusive negotiations until 5 p.m. ET on October 12, 2013, subject to certain conditions, including that CSC and Pamplona not adversely change or modify the terms of the CSC/Pamplona final proposal'),\n ('r4_open','On September 25, 2013, Goodwin Procter delivered to Kirkland & Ellis LLP, outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona, whom we refer to as Kirkland, the initial draft of the merger agreement'),\n ('r4_open','CSC and Pamplona were granted full access to the electronic data site and access to certain members of management and conducted confirmatory business and legal due diligence on Mac-Gray'),\n ('rollover_resolve','to provide Moab with the opportunity to resume discussions with CSC/Pamplona regarding a possible equity rollover of Moab\\u2019s shares in the transaction if Moab still had an interest in such a rollover'),\n ('rollover_resolve','Mr. Rothenberg engaged in various discussions with representatives of Pamplona during this time to discuss a possible rollover of Moab shares'),\n ('rollover_resolve','Mr. Daoust reported to the Special Committee that, after discussions between Moab and representatives of Pamplona, it was determined that Moab would not rollover any Moab shares in the transaction'),\n ('oct12_excl_ext','the Special Committee confirmed that the Transaction Committee and representatives of Mac-Gray were authorized to extend the exclusivity agreement until 11:59 p.m. on ET on October 15, 2013 if CSC/Pamplona would agree to a Mac-Gray termination fee of not more than $11 million'),\n]\nfor label, quote in fails:\n    qn = an(quote)\n    hits = [k for k,v in alln.items() if qn in v]\n    print(label, '=>', hits)\n    if not hits:\n        # find longest matching prefix\n        for k,v in alln.items():\n            # find similar\n            import difflib\n            m = difflib.SequenceMatcher(None, qn, v).find_longest_match(0, len(qn), 0, len(v))\n            if m.size > 60:\n                print('    best in', k, '->', v[m.b:m.b+120])\n                break\nEOF"},"output":"r1_open => ['P-021']\nnda_partyB => ['P-025']\ndeadline_0723 => ['P-033']\njul25_decision => ['P-034']\njul25_access => ['P-037']\nbid_partyA_sep10 => ['P-048']\nbid_partyC_sep10 => ['P-048']\nsep23_excl_auth => ['P-057']\nsep24_excl_exec => ['P-060']\nr4_open => ['P-061']\nr4_open => ['P-061']\nrollover_resolve => ['P-058']\nrollover_resolve => ['P-061']\nrollover_resolve => ['P-065']\noct12_excl_ext => []\n    best in P-070 -> he Special Committee confirmed that the Transaction Committee and representatives of Mac-Gray were authorized to extend \n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"r1_open => ['P-021']\nnda_partyB => ['P-025']\ndeadline_0723 => ['P-033']\njul25_decision => ['P-034']\njul25_access => ['P-037']\nbid_partyA_sep10 => ['P-048']\nbid_partyC_sep10 => ['P-048']\nsep23_excl_auth => ['P-057']\nsep24_excl_exec => ['P-060']\nr4_open => ['P-061']\nr4_open => ['P-061']\nrollover_resolve => ['P-058']\nrollover_resolve => ['P-061']\nrollover_resolve => ['P-065']\noct12_excl_ext => []\n    best in P-070 -> he Special Committee confirmed that the Transaction Committee and representatives of Mac-Gray were authorized to extend \n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/uctpiaj/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport js